# PowOS apps whose built UI (out/ui), manifest and module (out/module.wasm) ship inside the APK, one folder of apps/
# per line: on a phone without root nothing runs `powos app install`, so these are the launcher's own apps there
# (shell/LocalApps.kt, shell/apps/localapps.ts; docs/research/nonroot-parity.md #2). targets/android/build-app.sh builds
# each with apps/build.sh before the APK; app/build.gradle.kts copyApps puts them in assets/apps/<app id>/.
# Rooted phones keep using the installed copies (files/apps/<id>/current wins).
needs-me
pet
health
counter
sketch
app-api
devices
